function renderFechamento(){let groups=clientGroups().filter(g=>!closingSearch||searchKey(g.client?.name).includes(searchKey(closingSearch)));let pg=paginate('fechamento',groups);let t=totals(filterOrders());el('content').innerHTML=filters()+`<div class="metrics">${metric('Clientes com pedidos',nfmt(groups.length))}${metric('Pedidos',nfmt(t.orders))}${metric('Compras',money(t.total))}${metric('Saldo a receber',money(t.due))}</div><section class="card"><div class="field" style="max-width:430px;margin-bottom:15px"><label>Buscar cliente pelo nome</label><input id="closing-search" type="search" value="${esc(closingSearch)}" placeholder="Digite o nome do cliente…"></div><p class="tiny muted">${groups.length} cliente(s) no período/local selecionado.</p>${table(['Cliente','Local','Responsável','Pedidos','Total','Recebido','Saldo','Ação'],pg.visible.map(g=>`<tr class="${g.t.orders&&g.t.due===0?'row-paid':''}"><td><strong>${clientDot(g.client)}${esc(g.client?.name||'Cliente')}</strong></td><td>${esc(g.orders[0]?.location||'')}</td><td>${esc([...new Set(g.orders.map(o=>o.createdByName||'Não identificado'))].join(', '))}</td><td>${g.t.orders}</td><td>${money(g.t.total)}</td><td>${money(g.t.paid)}</td><td>${money(g.t.due)}</td><td><div class="actions">${button('Extrato','statement',g.cid)}${button('WhatsApp / texto','share',g.cid)}</div></td></tr>`).join(''))}${pagination('fechamento',pg)}</section>`;periodHandlers();el('closing-search').oninput=e=>{closingSearch=e.target.value;resetPage('fechamento');renderFechamento();restoreFocus(el('closing-search'))}}
function groupFor(cid){const orders=filterOrders().filter(o=>o.clientId===cid).sort((a,b)=>a.date.localeCompare(b.date)||a.createdAt.localeCompare(b.createdAt));const client=orders.length?historicalClient(cid,orders):db.clients.find(c=>c.id===cid);return {client,orders,t:totals(orders)}}
function openStatement(cid){const {client,orders,t}=groupFor(cid);if(!client)return;modal(`${head('Extrato do cliente')}<p><strong>${clientDot(client)}${esc(client.name)}</strong> · ${esc(client.location)} · ${esc(period)}</p><div class="metrics">${metric('Pedidos',String(t.orders))}${metric('Total de compras',money(t.total))}${metric('Recebido',money(t.paid))}${metric('A receber',money(t.due))}</div><div class="actions" style="margin:14px 0">${button('Extrato para WhatsApp','share',cid,'alt')}${allowed('admin','financeiro')&&t.due>0?button('Quitar todos os pedidos pendentes deste mês','bulk',cid,'dark'):''}</div>${orders.map((o,i)=>`<div class="card"><div class="section-title"><h4>Pedido ${i+1} · ${dateBR(o.date)}<br><span class="tiny muted">Responsável: ${esc(o.createdByName||'Não identificado')}</span></h4><span class="pill ${orderPaid(o)<orderTotal(o)?'due':'ok'}">${orderPaid(o)>=orderTotal(o)?'Pago':orderPaid(o)>0?'Parcial':'Pendente'}</span></div>${o.items.map(item=>`<div>${nfmt(item.qty)} × ${esc(item.name)} — ${money(item.qty*item.priceCents)}</div>`).join('')}<p><strong>Total: ${money(orderTotal(o))}</strong></p>${button('Ver pedido','view-order',o.id)}</div>`).join('')}<div class="footer-buttons"><button class="btn alt" data-close>Fechar</button></div>`,()=>openStatement(cid))}
function statementText(cid){let {client,orders,t}=groupFor(cid);return statementTextFromOrders(client,orders,period)}
function statementTextFromOrders(client,orders,monthPeriod,includeHeading=true){let year=monthPeriod.slice(0,4),month=monthNames[Number(monthPeriod.slice(5,7))-1]||monthPeriod;let divider='────────────────────';let ordered=orders.slice().sort((a,b)=>a.date.localeCompare(b.date)||a.createdAt.localeCompare(b.createdAt));let lines=includeHeading?['*SABORES DAS DIVAS*',`*Pedidos de ${month} de ${year}*`,`Cliente: ${client?.name||'Cliente'}`,divider]:[`Cliente: ${client?.name||'Cliente'}`,divider];ordered.forEach((o,index)=>{const paid=orderPaid(o),total=orderTotal(o),due=Math.max(0,total-paid);lines.push(`PEDIDO ${index+1} — ${dateBR(o.date)}`);o.items.forEach(i=>lines.push(`${i.qty} × ${i.name} — ${money(i.qty*i.priceCents)} (${money(i.priceCents)} un.)`));lines.push(`Total do pedido: ${money(total)}`);if(due===0)lines.push('Status: PAGO');else if(paid>0){lines.push(`Valor pago: ${money(paid)}`);lines.push(`Restante: ${money(due)}`)}lines.push(divider)});if(!ordered.length)lines.push('Nenhum pedido registrado neste mês.',divider);lines.push(`Quantidade de pedidos: ${ordered.length}`,`TOTAL A PAGAR: ${money(ordered.reduce((s,o)=>s+Math.max(0,orderTotal(o)-orderPaid(o)),0))}`);return lines.join('\n')}
function exportMonthlyText(){const rows=db.orders.filter(o=>o.date.startsWith(period));const m=new Map();rows.forEach(o=>{if(!m.has(o.clientId))m.set(o.clientId,[]);m.get(o.clientId).push(o)});const groups=[...m.entries()].map(([id,items])=>({client:historicalClient(id,items),items})).sort((a,b)=>a.client.name.localeCompare(b.client.name,'pt-BR'));
let text=`*SABORES DAS DIVAS*\n*RELATÓRIO GERAL — ${monthNames[Number(period.slice(5,7))-1]} DE ${period.slice(0,4)}*\n`+groups.map(({client,items})=>'-------------------------------------------------\n-------------------------------------------------\n'+statementTextFromOrders(client,items,period,false)).join('\n');if(!groups.length)text+='Nenhum pedido no período.';download('Pedidos_gerais_'+period+'.txt',text)}
function exportMonthlyCsv(){const rows=db.orders.filter(o=>o.date.startsWith(period)).sort((a,b)=>a.clientName.localeCompare(b.clientName,'pt-BR')||a.date.localeCompare(b.date));const csv=v=>'"'+String(v??'').replaceAll('"','""')+'"';let lines=[['Cliente','Local','Loja','Data','Pedido','Produto','Categoria','Quantidade','Valor unitário (R$)','Subtotal (R$)','Total pedido (R$)','Pago pedido (R$)','Saldo pedido (R$)','Responsável'].map(csv).join(';')];rows.forEach(o=>(o.items||[]).forEach((i,idx)=>lines.push([o.clientName,o.location,o.store,dateBR(o.date),o.id,i.name,i.category,i.qty,inputMoney(i.priceCents),inputMoney(i.qty*i.priceCents),idx===0?inputMoney(orderTotal(o)):'',idx===0?inputMoney(orderPaid(o)):'',idx===0?inputMoney(orderTotal(o)-orderPaid(o)):'',o.createdByName].map(csv).join(';'))));download('Pedidos_gerais_'+period+'.csv','\uFEFF'+lines.join('\r\n'),'text/csv;charset=utf-8')}
function whatsPhone(v){let d=String(v||'').replace(/\D/g,'');if(d.startsWith('55')&&(d.length===12||d.length===13))d=d.slice(2);return d.length===10||d.length===11?'55'+d:''}
